{"slug":"setup-quickstart","title":"Quickstart","blocks":[{"id":"b1","type":"ingress","content":[{"type":"text","value":"From nothing to a running Barkpark with a clean paper + media workspace. Three routes, one wizard. Written 2026-06-10 against the premium-setup branch; commands marked (wizard) ship with that release."}]},{"id":"b2","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Install bp"},{"id":"b3","type":"code","value":"curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/FRIKKern/barkpark/main/scripts/install-cli.sh | sh\nbp version"},{"id":"b4","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Windows","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":" (PowerShell) — see WINDOWS.md for the full guide:"}]},{"id":"b5","type":"code","value":"irm https://raw.githubusercontent.com/FRIKKern/barkpark/main/scripts/install-cli.ps1 | iex"},{"id":"b6","type":"table","head":[[{"type":"text","value":"Env"}],[{"type":"text","value":"Effect"}]],"rows":[[[{"type":"text","value":"BARKPARK_BIN_DIR","marks":["code"]}],[{"type":"text","value":"install dir (default "},{"type":"text","value":"/usr/local/bin","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", fallback "},{"type":"text","value":"~/.local/bin","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":")"}]],[[{"type":"text","value":"BARKPARK_CLI_VERSION","marks":["code"]}],[{"type":"text","value":"pin a release, e.g. "},{"type":"text","value":"1.0.1","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" (default: latest "},{"type":"text","value":"cli-v*","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":")"}]]]},{"id":"b7","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Binaries are sha256-verified against the release's "},{"type":"text","value":"checksums.txt","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" (hard-fail on mismatch; if a release ships no checksums the installer warns and continues)."}]},{"id":"b8","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"First run"},{"id":"b9","type":"code","value":"bp"},{"id":"b10","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"With no config and a real terminal, bare "},{"type":"text","value":"bp","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" launches the wizard and falls through into the TUI; "},{"type":"text","value":"bp setup","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" runs the same wizard and exits when done. Non-TTY / "},{"type":"text","value":"-o json","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"text","value":"--yes","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" never prompt — "},{"type":"text","value":"bp setup","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" without "},{"type":"text","value":"--target","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" exits with code 2 and directs you to "},{"type":"text","value":"bp setup -h","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"id":"b11","type":"table","head":[[{"type":"text","value":"Target"}],[{"type":"text","value":"Effect"}]],"rows":[[[{"type":"text","value":"connect","marks":["code"]}],[{"type":"text","value":"point bp at an existing server (non-destructive)"}]],[[{"type":"text","value":"local","marks":["code"]}],[{"type":"text","value":"bring up a dev server on this machine"}]],[[{"type":"text","value":"deploy","marks":["code"]}],[{"type":"text","value":"install on a server you own over SSH"}]],[[{"type":"text","value":"provision","marks":["code"]}],[{"type":"text","value":"create a cloud host (hetzner / azure), then deploy"}]]]},{"id":"b12","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Local"},{"id":"b13","type":"code","value":"bp setup --target local --yes"},{"id":"b14","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Destructive: runs ","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":"mix ecto.reset","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":".","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":" A running dev server holds DB connections and blocks the reset ("},{"type":"text","value":"object_in_use","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":") — stop it first, or use "},{"type":"text","value":"--target connect","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":". Native "},{"type":"text","value":"mix","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" by default; "},{"type":"text","value":"--docker","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" uses compose. With no existing checkout in a parent directory, bp clones to "},{"type":"text","value":"${BARKPARK_HOME:-~/.barkpark}/src","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":". Missing prereqs print the exact install command — bp never runs brew/apt:"}]},{"id":"b15","type":"table","head":[[{"type":"text","value":"Need"}],[{"type":"text","value":"Why"}]],"rows":[[[{"type":"text","value":"Elixir/mix + git"}],[{"type":"text","value":"build + clone"}]],[[{"type":"text","value":"Postgres on "},{"type":"text","value":":5432","marks":["code"]}],[{"type":"text","value":"the store — role gotcha: SETUP.md"}]],[[{"type":"text","value":"libvips"}],[{"type":"text","value":"media probing (warn-only)"}]]]},{"id":"b16","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Deploy"},{"id":"b17","type":"code","value":"bp setup --target deploy --ssh-host root@VPS_IP --domain api.example.com --yes"},{"id":"b18","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"--domain","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" must be the public DNS name — baking an IP behind an HTTPS name will break the Studio ("},{"type":"text","value":"check_origin","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":"; see PROD_OPS.md). Lands on the box: ASDF Erlang/Elixir, Postgres, the systemd "},{"type":"text","value":"barkpark","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" unit."}]},{"id":"b19","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Connect"},{"id":"b20","type":"code","value":"bp setup --target connect --server https://api.example.com --token $TOKEN"},{"id":"b21","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Re-running connect with no "},{"type":"text","value":"--server","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" reconnects to the active saved server. "},{"type":"text","value":"bp servers","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" lists saved servers; "},{"type":"text","value":"bp use <name>","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" switches; "},{"type":"text","value":"--name","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" saves a handle."}]},{"id":"b22","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Provision"},{"id":"b23","type":"code","value":"bp setup --target provision --provider hetzner --dry-run"},{"id":"b24","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Staged: plans only unless the provider CLI ("},{"type":"text","value":"hcloud","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"text","value":"az","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":"), a credential, and "},{"type":"text","value":"--yes","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" are all present. Chains into deploy."}]},{"id":"b25","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Headless / CI"},{"id":"b26","type":"code","value":"bp setup --target local --dry-run -o json | head -c 400   # plan shows profile: clean"},{"id":"b27","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Every target supports "},{"type":"text","value":"--dry-run","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" (plan only, runs nothing) and "},{"type":"text","value":"-o json","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" (one machine-readable object)."}]},{"id":"b28","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Verify"},{"id":"b29","type":"code","value":"bp whoami                                   # active server + auth tier\nbp capabilities -o json | head -c 400       # the API surface, via your saved config\ncurl -s localhost:4000/api/schemas | head -c 200   # local target only"},{"id":"b30","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Demo data"},{"id":"b31","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Fresh installs seed the clean profile (wizard): a welcome paper at "},{"type":"text","value":"/papers/welcome","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", one admin token, the paper/media schemas — nothing else. The 8-schema / 27-document demo set is opt-in:"}]},{"id":"b32","type":"code","value":"bp setup --target local --profile demo --yes              # via bp\nBARKPARK_SEED_PROFILE=demo mix run priv/repo/seeds.exs    # raw mix, in api/ — additive,\n                                                          # keeps your admin token (ecto.reset would wipe it)"},{"id":"b33","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Use it as a task system"},{"id":"b34","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"The clean profile ships the Tasks plugin enabled — your AI gets a claimable, dependency-aware work queue out of the box:"}]},{"id":"b35","type":"code","value":"bp task ready                                    # unblocked queue, priority-ordered\nbp task next agent-1                             # atomically claim the next ready task\nbp task claim t1 agent-1                         # …or claim a specific one\nbp task close t1 agent-1 1                       # <id> <worker> <observed_epoch>"},{"id":"b36","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Full guide — agent loop, Studio collaboration, goals/phases, troubleshooting: TASK-SYSTEM.md."}]},{"id":"b37","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Golden path"},{"id":"b38","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"type":"text","value":"--dry-run","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" before "},{"type":"text","value":"--yes","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", always."}],[{"type":"text","value":"Local DB ops are bare "},{"type":"text","value":"mix","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" in "},{"type":"text","value":"api/","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" — never "},{"type":"text","value":"make seed/migrate","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" (prod wrappers)."}],[{"type":"text","value":"Deploys take a DNS name in "},{"type":"text","value":"--domain","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", never an IP."}],[{"type":"text","value":"The clean seed prints its admin token "},{"type":"text","value":"once","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":" — store it (bp saves it to "},{"type":"text","value":"$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/barkpark/config.json","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" — default "},{"type":"text","value":"~/.config","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" — 0600)."}],[{"type":"text","value":"Server updates: ssh in, "},{"type":"text","value":"git pull","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" (the post-merge hook rebuilds + restarts)."}],[{"type":"text","value":"Reconfigure by re-running "},{"type":"text","value":"bp setup","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", not by hand-editing "},{"type":"text","value":"config.json","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]]},{"id":"b39","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Canon: "},{"type":"text","value":"../cli/HANDBOOK.md","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" (bp semantics) · "},{"type":"text","value":"SETUP.md","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" (from-source) · "},{"type":"text","value":"../ops/PROD_OPS.md","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" (server ops)."}]}],"related":["setup-windows","setup-setup","ops-prod-ops","setup-task-system","cli-handbook"]}
